      ":question/problem": "Using the fact that\n\n$$\n-\\frac{5\\pi}{12}=\\frac{5\\pi}{6}-\\frac{5\\pi}{4},\n$$\n\ncalculate the **exact** value of $\\cos\\left(-\\frac{5\\pi}{12}\\right)$.\n\n$\\cos\\left(-\\frac{5\\pi}{12}\\right)=$ {{field-1}}",
